[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 127 A famous actress Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 0.63,
    "end": 11.272,
    "zh": "第127课 一位著名女演员 听录音,然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "第127課 一位著名女演員 聽錄音,然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Who is only twenty-nine,",
    "start": 12.096,
    "end": 14.857,
    "zh": "谁只有二十九岁，",
    "zh_hant": "誰只有二十九歲，"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "and why is it so unclear?",
    "start": 14.958,
    "end": 18.379,
    "zh": "为什么这么不清楚？",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼這麼不清楚？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Can you recognize that woman, Liz?",
    "start": 20.52,
    "end": 24.522,
    "zh": "你能认出那个女人吗，莉兹？",
    "zh_hant": "你能認出那個女人嗎，莉茲？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "I think I can, Kate.",
    "start": 25.283,
    "end": 27.804,
    "zh": "我想我能，凯特。",
    "zh_hant": "我想我能，凱特。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "It must be Karen Marsh,",
    "start": 28.244,
    "end": 31.386,
    "zh": "一定是凯伦·马什，",
    "zh_hant": "一定是凱倫·馬什，"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "the actress.",
    "start": 31.286,
    "end": 32.766,
    "zh": "那位女演员。",
    "zh_hant": "那位女演員。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "I thought so.",
    "start": 33.427,
    "end": 34.687,
    "zh": "我也这么想。",
    "zh_hant": "我也這麼想。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Who's that beside her?",
    "start": 35.268,
    "end": 37.489,
    "zh": "她旁边是谁？",
    "zh_hant": "她旁邊是誰？"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "That must be Conrad Reeves.",
    "start": 38.289,
    "end": 41.951,
    "zh": "那一定是康拉德·里夫斯。",
    "zh_hant": "那一定是康拉德·裡夫斯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Conrad Reeves, the actor?",
    "start": 42.672,
    "end": 45.533,
    "zh": "康拉德·里夫斯，那个演员？",
    "zh_hant": "康拉德·裡夫斯，那個演員？"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "It can't be.",
    "start": 45.833,
    "end": 47.234,
    "zh": "不可能。",
    "zh_hant": "不可能。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Let me have another look.",
    "start": 47.774,
    "end": 50.355,
    "zh": "让我再看一眼。",
    "zh_hant": "讓我再看一眼。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "I think you're right!",
    "start": 51.296,
    "end": 53.237,
    "zh": "我想你是对的！",
    "zh_hant": "我想你是對的！"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Isn't he her third husband?",
    "start": 53.577,
    "end": 56.879,
    "zh": "他不是她的第三任丈夫吗？",
    "zh_hant": "他不是她的第三任丈夫嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "No.",
    "start": 57.499,
    "end": 58.119,
    "zh": "不是。",
    "zh_hant": "不是。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "He must be her fourth or fifth.",
    "start": 58.82,
    "end": 62.501,
    "zh": "他一定是她的第四或第五任。",
    "zh_hant": "他一定是她的第四或第五任。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Doesn't Karen Marsh look old!",
    "start": 63.762,
    "end": 66.903,
    "zh": "凯伦·马什看起来真老啊！",
    "zh_hant": "凱倫·馬什看起來真老啊！"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "She does, doesn't she!",
    "start": 67.604,
    "end": 70.145,
    "zh": "确实，不是吗！",
    "zh_hant": "確實，不是嗎！"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "I read she's twenty-nine,",
    "start": 71.186,
    "end": 74.407,
    "zh": "我读到她说她二十九岁，",
    "zh_hant": "我讀到她說她二十九歲，"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "but she must be at least forty.",
    "start": 74.748,
    "end": 78.129,
    "zh": "但她肯定至少四十岁了。",
    "zh_hant": "但她肯定至少四十歲了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "I'm sure she is.",
    "start": 79.23,
    "end": 81.452,
    "zh": "我确信是这样。",
    "zh_hant": "我確信是這樣。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "She was a famous actress",
    "start": 82.514,
    "end": 85.056,
    "zh": "她是个著名的女演员，",
    "zh_hant": "她是個著名的女演員，"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "when I was still at school.",
    "start": 84.936,
    "end": 87.758,
    "zh": "在我还在上学的时候。",
    "zh_hant": "在我還在上學的時候。"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "That was a long time ago, wasn't it?",
    "start": 88.86,
    "end": 92.763,
    "zh": "那是很久以前了，不是吗？",
    "zh_hant": "那是很久以前了，不是嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Not that long ago!",
    "start": 93.404,
    "end": 95.546,
    "zh": "没那么久！",
    "zh_hant": "沒那麼久！"
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "I'm not more than twenty-nine myself.",
    "start": 96.447,
    "end": 100.09,
    "zh": "我自己也不到二十九岁。",
    "zh_hant": "我自己也不到二十九歲。"
  }
]
